   339	## §8 — Workflow Status Display (Chat rendering)
   340	
   341	### 8.1 Rendering shape
   342	
   343	Chat's per-task slice structure requires a **two-tier** status display, backed by
   344	`state.json.workflow.chat.tasks[currentIndex]` (R3 lock from the `workflow.chat.tasks[]`
   345	array-of-slices schema).
   346	
   347	**Header form (Chat):**
   348	
   349	```
   350	Workflow Status — Mode: chat — Active: Task {NN} — {step-name}
   351	```
   352	
   353	where `{step-name}` is one of: `Step 2 Full Ideation`, `Step 3 Preparation ⊘ Skipped`, `Step 4 mini Planning`, `Step 5 mini Execution`, `task-record`. The step name identifies the current row in the per-task tier of the body form below; Step 3 renders as ⊘ Skipped when default.
   354	
   355	**Body form (Chat) — two-tier:**
   356	
   357	Top tier (session-level):
   358	
   359	| Phase | Status |
   360	|-------|--------|
   361	| Configuration | ✓ Done |
   362	| Current task | ▸ Task {NN} — {slug} |
   363	| Wrap-up | … Pending — awaiting user signal |
   364	
   365	Per-task tier (current task sub-table):
   366	
   367	| Step | Loop | State | Iter | Verdict |
   368	|------|------|-------|------|---------|
   369	| 2 | Ideation | {state} | {n} | {verdict} |
   370	| 3 | Preparation | ⊘ Skipped | — | — |
   371	| 4 | mini Planning | {state} | {n} | {verdict} |
   372	| 5 | mini Execution | {state} | {n} | {verdict} |
   373	| — | task-record | {written\|pending} | — | — |
   374	
   375	**Render points:** unchanged — every `AskUserQuestion` call in Chat; every loop boundary.
   376	
   377	**Auto Mode rendering:** unchanged — the existing 6-row table in `orchestration/SKILL.md §
   378	Workflow Status Display` is the canonical Auto view.
   379	
   380	### 8.2 Per-task state-transition table (F-S2)
   381	
   382	Parallel to `orchestration/SKILL.md § Loop states`. This table covers the per-task slice's
   383	state-transition contract for Chat Mode.
   384	
